                    "x": 141.26,
                    "width": 382.0426400000001,
                    "isHeading": false,
                    "headingLevel": 3
                },
                {
                    "text": "After receipt of the revised plans on 23.08.2025 and 06.09.2025 (the latter pursuant to a specific extension approved by the CoC), the plans were placed before the CoC on 29.08.2025 and 10.09.2025. A brief periodthereafterwasutilizedforclarifications,legalvetting,and ensuringcompliancewiththeprovisionsoftheInsolvencyand Bankruptcy Code, 2016 and the applicable Regulations as issued by the Insolvency and Bankruptcy Board of India (IBBI)",
                    "y": 553.51,
