                    "lineCount": 7,
                    "x": 141.26,
                    "width": 382.24208,
                    "isHeading": false,
                    "headingLevel": 3
                },
                {
                    "text": "Subsequently, the CoC, in its meeting held on 29.09.2025, decided to put the Resolution Plans to vote. Voting commenced on 06.10.2025, and the Resolution Plan stood approved on the same date.",
