                {
                    "text": "Sr.ParticularsDescription 1.NameofSuccessfulCIAN Agro Industries & Infrastructure Limited. Resolution Applicant (SRA) 2.NatureofBusiness of SRAa.CIANisa BSEListedCompanywithmorethan2 decades of expertiseinAgroIndustry.",
