                {
                    "text": "(ii)theResolutionApplicantCIANAgroIndustries&Infrastructure Limitedhas submitted an affidavit pursuant to Section 30(1) of the Code confirming its eligibility under Section 29A of the Code to submit resolution plan. The contents of the said affidavit are in order.",
