                    "fontFamily": "unknown",
                    "confidence": null,
                    "lineCount": 4,
                    "isHeading": false,
                    "headingLevel": 3
                },
                {
                    "text": "(iii)the said Resolution Plan has been approved by the CoC in accordance with theprovisions of the Code and the CIRP Regulations made thereunder. The Resolution Plan has been approved by 100% of voting share of financial creditorsafterconsideringitsfeasibilityandviabilityandother requirements specified by the CIRP Regulations.",
